OL,3,GNEWSALabour calls for M4 relief road,
OL,4,Aseven years after axing the plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FLabour's Welsh leader has called for
OL,7,Fthe Plaid Cymru administration to start
OL,8,Fwork on an M4 relief road - seven years
OL,9,Fafter his party had axed it.
OL,11,FKen Skates told BBC Wales that there
OL,12,Fwas "no other option on the table" to
OL,13,Fsolve congestion in Newport, and has
OL,14,Fbacked a version of the original plan
OL,15,Fwith changes.
OL,17,FThe move will be seen by some as an
OL,18,Fattempt to distance Welsh Labour from
OL,19,Fpart of the legacy of former First
OL,20,FMinister Mark Drakeford.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
