OL,3,GNEWSALabour calls for M4 relief road,
OL,4,Aseven years after axing the plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FLabour will table a vote in the Senedd
OL,7,Fon Wednesday calling for an
OL,8,F"appropriate relief road" to be built.
